  "bio": "Pixie Cat is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in fineline, dotwork, and black & gray styles, bringing a unique illustrative blackwork approach to each piece. Nestled in the heart of Cork, Ireland, at Artlab Tattoo Studio, Pixie maintains an impeccable standard of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client. Their meticulous attention to detail and dedication to their craft are evident not just in their tattoos but also in the spotless state of their workspace.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nGenetically about 56% cat.\nTattooist 🐝\nIllustrative • Blackwork\n@artlabtattoostudio\n\nGenetically about 56% cat.\nTattooist 🐝\nIllustrative • Blackwork\n@artlabtattoostudio",
